body:
We try to avoid custom `GetSize` implementations. It's very easy to forget updating them when adding a field. Instead, derive `GetSize` and use the field-level attribute to customize the `relative_path`'s size calculation:

```rust
#[derive(Debug, Clone, PartialEq, Eq, Hash, get_size2::GetSize)]
pub(crate) struct ModulePath {
    search_path: SearchPath,
    #[get_size(size_fn=utf8_path_buf_size)]
    relative_path: Utf8PathBuf,
}

fn utf8_path_buf_size(path: &Utf8PathBuf) -> usize {
    path.as_std_path().get_heap_size()
}
```

